 ("Politics","The promise of participation","Decentralisation, personal initiative and participatory democracy suggested that people might gain more influence.","Government-oriented frameworks examined legitimacy, public debt, insecurity and the changing balance of international power.","Can institutions rebuild consent and coordinate across borders under geopolitical and domestic pressure?"),
